<title>DUBAI: QUALITY-Lufthansa Sharjah Dec cargo report.</title>
<headline>QUALITY-Lufthansa Sharjah Dec cargo report.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa Cargo AG, an autonomous unit of Deutsche Lufthansa AG, issued its latest monthly report on service standards achieved at its Sharjah, United Arab Emirates hub.</p>
<p>The report gives results claimed by LCAG Sharjah for December 1996.</p>
<p> Customer commitment	   Achievement</p>
<p>				     Dec 1996	Nov 1996</p>
<p> Flown as booked		  96pct	    96pct</p>
<p>Import cargo ready for pick up</p>
<p>-perishables: one hour</p>
<p>  after flight arrival	 100pct	   100pct</p>
<p>-general: five hours</p>
<p>  after flight arrival	 100pct	   100pct</p>
<p>Export acceptance</p>
<p> waiting time		    100pct	   100pct</p>
<p> -up to one tonne:	     one hour</p>
<p> -one to five tonnes:	  two hours</p>
<p> -five to ten tonnes:	  three hours</p>
<p>Telephone answered</p>
<p> -by third ring		   83 pct	   89pct</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
